      "post_id": "2088334748007420220",
      "url": "https://x.com/nonoo_techie/status/2088334748007420220",
      "text": "I saw some beautiful dresses on SHEIN and my hands are itching me to place an order, but at the same time, I’m a bit scared. 👀\n\nI don’t want to end up receiving “what I ordered vs what I received.” 😭🤣\n\nThis will actually be my first time getting anything from the app.\n\nI deleted Temu, now it’s SHEIN. 🤷🏾‍♀️😂\n\nHave you shopped on SHEIN before? How was your experience?",
      "original_text": "I saw some beautiful dresses on SHEIN and my hands are itching me to place an order, but at the same time, I’m a bit scared. 👀\n\nI don’t want to end up receiving “what I ordered vs what I received.” 😭🤣\n\nThis will actually be my first time getting anything from the app.\n\nI deleted Temu, now it’s SHEIN. 🤷🏾‍♀️😂\n\nHave you shopped on SHEIN before? How was your experience?",
      "links": [],
      "translation_zh": "我在 SHEIN 上看到一些漂亮的裙子，手痒得想下单，但同时我又有点害怕。👀\n\n我不想最后收到那种“我下单的 vs 我收到的”。😭🤣\n\n这其实会是我第一次从这个 app 上买东西。\n\n我删了 Temu，现在轮到 SHEIN 了。🤷🏾‍♀️😂\n\n你以前在 SHEIN 上买过东西吗？体验怎么样？",
